five receptions for 42 yards and a touchdown, before exiting the game early with an injury. Craver finished his freshman season hauling in 17 receptions for 368 yards and three touchdowns. On December 9, 2024, Craver announced that he would enter the transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS A&M\nOn December 17, 2024, Craver announced that he would be committing to Texas A&M University."}]}}